OL,3,AColombia's new president loosens gun
OL,4,Acontrol rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FColombian President Abelardo de la
OL,7,FEspriella has signed a decree which
OL,8,Feases restrictions on people carrying
OL,9,Flegal firearms in public.
OL,11,FDe la Espriella, who during his
OL,12,Fcampaign for the presidency promised to
OL,13,Ftake an iron-fist approach to crime,
OL,14,Fsaid it was "not right that criminals
OL,15,Fare armed to the teeth while decent
OL,16,Fpeople can't defend themselves".
OL,18,FThe decree lifts a suspension that had
OL,19,Fbeen in force for a decade, which meant
OL,20,Fthat even those in possession of a
OL,21,Fpermit to carry guns could not do so
OL,22,Fwithout additional authorisation.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
