OL,3,AColombia's new president loosens gun
OL,4,Acontrol rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FDe la Espriella insisted that the
OL,7,Fdecree would not create a free-for-all
OL,8,Fand that tight controls over who can
OL,9,Fown a gun would remain in place.
